  "body": "Step into a lifestyle where everyday living feels like a relaxed coastal escape. Positioned in a sought-after, family-friendly pocket of Gulf Harbour, this generous 4 bedroom, 2.5 bathroom residence delivers the space, functional layout, and modern comfort your growing family has been searching for.\r\n\r\nKey Features You'll Love:\r\n• Generous Accommodation: 4 light-filled bedrooms, including a private master suite designed to offer a peaceful retreat at the end of the day.\r\n• Smart & Functional Layout: 2 full bathrooms plus an additional guest toilet (2.5 bathrooms total) eliminating the morning rush for busy households.\r\n• Effortless Entertaining: Expansive open-plan living and dining spaces seamlessly connect to sun-drenched outdoor decking and a private, low-maintenance yard ideal for summer BBQs, outdoor dining, and kids & pets to play safely.\r\n• Double Garage & Storage: Internal-access garaging with extra off-street parking for boats, jetskis, or visitor vehicles.\r\n\r\nUnbeatable Gulf Harbour Location: Located in the heart of the Whangaparaoa Peninsula, you are just moments away from top local amenities:\r\n• Top Schooling: In zone for Gulf Harbour School, Whangaparaoa College & Wentworth College and Primary\r\n• Outdoor & Marina Lifestyle: Minutes to the Gulf Harbour Marina (with direct ferry access to Auckland CBD) and scenic walking trails at Shakespear Regional Park.\r\n• Local Convenience: Close to local cafés, restaurants, parks, and nearby beaches.\r\n\r\nWhether you're upsizing for your family or looking to secure a quality home in an unbeatable family community, this property offers incredible lifestyle appeal.\r\n\r\nDon't wait, contact us today to arrange your private viewing or join us at the open home!",
